{"content_hash": "d84887f8d403a1b5", "version_id": 1012, "article_id": 102, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Rockstar lets podcast hosts finish GTA6 early", "title_zh": "R星提前让播客主持人玩通《GTA6》", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/radios/222501", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1605792218927-761ce7dcc100?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8Nnx8Z3RhJTIwdm9sfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTUwNTYyMDZ8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Keith Banks on Unsplash", "author": "Keith Banks", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@colorbyibanks?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/man-in-black-jacket-standing-near-road-during-daytime-RVL_lvzr3Ks?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(353, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(31, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "fd193e0ff998"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-19", "word_count": 110, "reading_minutes": 0.6, "lead": "Three hosts from the Chinese gaming site Gcores played GTA6 all the way to the end. Rockstar Games gave them the chance to try the game before its release.", "lead_zh": "中国游戏媒体机核的三位主持人把《GTA6》从头玩到了结尾。这个机会是Rockstar Games给的，让他们在游戏正式发售前先试玩。", "preview": "The episode is called Gadio Wave Vol.135. The hosts are Nadya, Xuedou and Bai Guangda. They shared how they felt after finishing the game. T", "preview_zh": "这期节目叫《机浪》第135期，主持人是Nadya、雪豆和白广大。他们聊了通关之后的感受，还说这款游戏展现了当今游戏工业的最高水平。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 995, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 40.55, "size_bytes": 244224, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 128, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 41.625, "size_bytes": 250704, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 128, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/102/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 44.425, "size_bytes": 267552, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 128, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/102/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 37.125, "size_bytes": 223776, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 128, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/102/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/102/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 40.625, "size_bytes": 244656, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 128, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/102/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@23dfc2cf/content/data/versions/1012.json", "paragraphs": ["The episode is called Gadio Wave Vol.135. The hosts are Nadya, Xuedou and Bai Guangda. They shared how they felt after finishing the game. They also said the game shows the best of the game industry today.", "The team said they will not spoil the story. They posted a video version of the talk on Bilibili too. In it, host Ximeng gives his own opinion of GTA6. The audio episode is about 73 minutes long.", "GTA6 is the next game in the famous Grand Theft Auto series. Rockstar Games is still working on it. Fans have waited a long time for news. The new episode already has over 30,000 plays."], "paragraphs_zh": ["这期节目叫《机浪》第135期，主持人是Nadya、雪豆和白广大。他们聊了通关之后的感受，还说这款游戏展现了当今游戏工业的最高水平。", "团队表示不会剧透剧情。他们还在B站发布了视频版，主持人在视频里谈了自己对《GTA6》的看法。这期音频节目大约73分钟。", "《GTA6》是著名《侠盗猎车手》系列的新作，目前Rockstar Games还在开发中。玩家等消息已经等了很久，这期新节目播放量已经超过3万。"], "body": "The episode is called Gadio Wave Vol.135. The hosts are Nadya, Xuedou and Bai Guangda. They shared how they felt after finishing the game. They also said the game shows the best of the game industry today.\n\nThe team said they will not spoil the story. They posted a video version of the talk on Bilibili too. In it, host Ximeng gives his own opinion of GTA6. The audio episode is about 73 minutes long.\n\nGTA6 is the next game in the famous Grand Theft Auto series. Rockstar Games is still working on it. Fans have waited a long time for news. The new episode already has over 30,000 plays.", "body_zh": "这期节目叫《机浪》第135期，主持人是Nadya、雪豆和白广大。他们聊了通关之后的感受，还说这款游戏展现了当今游戏工业的最高水平。\n\n团队表示不会剧透剧情。他们还在B站发布了视频版，主持人在视频里谈了自己对《GTA6》的看法。这期音频节目大约73分钟。\n\n《GTA6》是著名《侠盗猎车手》系列的新作，目前Rockstar Games还在开发中。玩家等消息已经等了很久，这期新节目播放量已经超过3万。", "text": "The episode is called Gadio Wave Vol.135. The hosts are Nadya, Xuedou and Bai Guangda. They shared how they felt after finishing the game. They also said the game shows the best of the game industry today. The team said they will not spoil the story. They posted a video version of the talk on Bilibili too. In it, host Ximeng gives his own opinion of GTA6. The audio episode is about 73 minutes long. GTA6 is the next game in the famous Grand Theft Auto series. Rockstar Games is still working on it. Fans have waited a long time for news. The new episode already has over 30,000 plays.", "vocab": [{"word": "finish", "pos": "verb", "zh": "完成，通关", "note": "finish a game 表示把游戏打通关", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "host", "pos": "noun", "zh": "主持人", "note": "播客或节目的主持人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "episode", "pos": "noun", "zh": "（节目的）一期", "note": "常与 podcast 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "share", "pos": "verb", "zh": "分享", "note": "share feelings 分享感受", "phonetic": "", "en": ""},